<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―A faint light.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dim light was filtering in through the gaps in the blinds.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\なつみの部屋明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
My whole body ached.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd slept on the floor, after pushing my body that hard yesterday.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, that wasn't quite right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I thought I'd fallen asleep on the floor, but...<PG>
I was on the bed. When had I gotten into bed...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And my clothes had been changed too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The handcuffs were off as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's going on?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, good morning, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s voice... 
{PAUSE ""}
I could still hear <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s voice.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ムスカリの花.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. So you came, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> was holding two steaming cups.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She set them on the table and put her hand on my forehead.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ考えるバストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, no fever. I'm glad you seem all right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"U-um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! What's going on!? The earthquake yesterday, and the bodies, and―!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"M-</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, calm down!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Here, I made coffee."</STYLE><PG>
Still not sure the <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> in front of me was real, I fired every question I could think of at her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> soothed me, telling me to <STYLE ID="1">"calm down."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then this <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> is... really, truly real...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I have no idea what happened either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Yesterday I heard you were being transferred to Motoki Prison, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So I was driving over to Motoki Prison, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"To visit me?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. I figured a new place would be stressful. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I thought if you saw me, it might make things even a little easier for you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So that's how it was... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm glad... I'm so glad you're safe..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm really glad you're safe too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I went to the prison, but they said no visits yet this week, and when I started heading home..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's when the earthquake hit you."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... I could still drive the car somehow, but it took me a long time to get back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But why is <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> alive?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I just happened not to meet any living people yesterday, and there are lots of other survivors?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... there wasn't anyone alive."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I thought I'd been left all alone in this town. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There was no sign of any rescue coming either... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I wondered if I was the only one who'd been sent off to some other world..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> seemed to have thought the same thing I had.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently my state of mind hadn't been much of an outlier.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "242" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, then we have to get out of here, fast...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, if you run away from here, it's prison again...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, yes, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Besides, there's no guarantee it's safe outside Motoki City, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Maybe it's like this all over Japan, no, all over the world?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That can't be...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Up until yesterday, I did mean to get away from here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　But now that I've found you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I thought staying here, just the two of us, might not be so bad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Can't we?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">We can't..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Of course we can't!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the first time in a long while I'd raised my voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Live here, the two of us?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In this town full of corpses, buried under cherry blossoms nobody can explain?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I will never let <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, with her whole future ahead of her, live like that.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Listen, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're only just past 30. You're still young. You still have a future."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, were you always this weak?"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I have precognition, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\blind_up.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> opened all the blinds she had kept shut.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ホラー.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "真明徴編.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Beyond the window, <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ぬ">wet</STYLE> with condensation, cherry petals danced in calmer numbers than yesterday, and dark, murky clouds blotted out the sun.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By some miracle I had found <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, but the nightmare itself was still <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="なま">seductively</STYLE> flaunting its form before my eyes.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I didn't get any intuition at all yesterday. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I think we'll be okay here for a while, even if we stay. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But I want to get out of Motoki City too, now that it's like this. Even if it is where I was born and raised..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then... have you listened to the radio?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, not yet..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> opened the closet and pulled out a big box.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\なつみの部屋明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"There should be a battery-powered radio in here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\tool-box1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
The box was packed with relics from decades ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Toys <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> had played with as a child, a tube holding a diploma.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So these were <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s keepsakes.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I put a radio in here too, for times like this. I hope it still works..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, is this it?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\ラジオ電池切れ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A small radio, about the size of my palm.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked old-fashioned, but there was no sign it was broken.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's the one! Um, the batteries..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, I've got some. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Wait, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, how did you get my handcuffs off?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? The key was in the jacket you had on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right under my nose the whole time...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\ラジオ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\ラジオノイズ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, it's fine. Looks like it's not broken."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Can it pick anything up...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Clear static came from the radio.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If we could tune in to a station, we should be able to get some information, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "VOICE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE2" "1000" "500" "PASS"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE2" "0" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm! Right around there!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I heard someone's voice."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE2" "1000" "500" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"―That concludes the Chief Cabinet Secretary's regular press conference. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Er, as we have been reporting since yesterday, a major earthquake has struck the area around Motoki City in Sawa Prefecture, along with damage caused by toxic gas."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Toxic gas...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But it sounds like the damage was limited to Motoki City."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The radio was still carrying reports on the disaster.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"At around 10:30 a.m. yesterday, an earthquake with an intensity of 7 occurred in Motoki City, Sawa Prefecture. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">The focus was extremely shallow, and the magnitude is estimated at 5.0. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">According to experts, because the magnitude, which indicates the scale of an earthquake, was extremely small for the intensity, the earthquake is believed to have occurred several dozen meters underground."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"In addition, outside Motoki City, where an intensity of 7 was observed, the intensity reached no more than about 4, and it appears that severe damage occurred only in Motoki City, at the epicenter. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">The Self-Defense Forces are currently preparing a rescue, but deadly gas has been released around Motoki City, and at present even the Self-Defense Forces are unable to approach."</STYLE><PG>
I more or less understood the situation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There had been an earthquake, and deadly gas had been released.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had people died because of this toxic gas?<PG>
But there were exceptions.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the very least, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and I were alive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And without even being aware of any toxic gas.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"The most striking feature of this disaster is the appearance of gigantic plants. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">At present a 100 km radius around Motoki City has been made a no-entry zone, and the details cannot be confirmed, but according to satellite images, there are countless shadows that appear to be gigantic plants. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">However, due to dense fog, it has not been possible to capture them clearly."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"At this rate, help won't come for a while..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're not feeling sick?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I mean, the toxic gas..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, yeah. I don't really feel anything..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and I felt none of the effects of the toxic gas that was supposed to be there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe by some fluke, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and I had just happened to avoid breathing the gas right after it was released.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tried forcing that interpretation on it, but it still didn't <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ふ">sit right</STYLE> with me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Anyway, have something warm to drink. You need to calm down a little..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay, thank you. But how did you make this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I just put the kettle on top of that heater."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, right, you can boil water on this kind of heater."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apart from the radio, every utility was dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that sense, it's less convenient than prison.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\コーヒーカップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Warm steam rising from the cup.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In prison they never served anything like coffee.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At most there was cold coffee milk in a carton, nothing with an aroma like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. If I hadn't gotten out of prison, I'd never have tasted this again...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's good..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm glad..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ムスカリの花.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"In prison, they serve you three meals every day, you go to bed and get up at set times, and they even look after your health."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uh-huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"People often say prison must be healthy, since you get to live a regular life, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That's not true. In exchange for a regular life, you lose your freedom. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">You're not even allowed to drink coffee."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So you do regret it? What happened in Megasawa..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... I'm glad."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Glad?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. Because the </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> I knew until now never looked like she regretted it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But no matter what the circumstances, killing people is wrong. There had to be some other way."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry. I don't mean to lecture you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, now that I've heard you regret it, I can finally feel relieved."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... listen, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">There's something I never told you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">No, it's nothing. I think I can tell you once things have calmed down more."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............?"</STYLE><PG>
Yes, this is a fact I can never tell.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Above all, I can never tell <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If we could run to the ends of the earth, maybe I could tell her then.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\なつみの部屋明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"But still, I think it's a good thing it's only now that you came to regret it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Because otherwise, you might not be alive now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You mean this disaster?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're right. Every cloud has a silver lining, I suppose."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm not sure this situation counts as a silver lining..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Heh. You have a point there..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, that's the first time I've seen you laugh in 15 years."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I never once laughed, all that time..."</STYLE><PG>
I took another sip of the coffee, now just a little lukewarm.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The aroma of the coffee, mellowed to body warmth in my mouth, delighted my sense of smell through my <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="びこう">nasal passages</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, but still, we can't stay here forever. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">We might be able to find food around here, but you don't want to stay in a place like this until you die, do you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ考えるバストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... What should we do? Wait for rescue?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That might be best, but... When will they ever come?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Once the toxic gas clears, or once they've got gear like spacesuits ready, probably."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"There's no end in sight yet."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Why don't we try going to see </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">? Do you know where she is?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Probably the Arata settlement, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">The police apparently searched Arata too, but it seems they didn't find her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What do you mean?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> took </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and ran, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　So I think the settlement is hiding them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If we're only going to visit, maybe they'd let us see her? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No, not just that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> rested her hand on my leg.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what if they hid you there too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But that's..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ考えるバストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"But...! But really, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, none of it was your fault!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　You were only trying to save me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the others, and you got a life sentence...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If you regret it... then that's enough already... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―if they're in Arata... then together..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I understand what you're trying to say. I have things I want to say to society too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But whatever the case, this is society's rule."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But that society is broken now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　At this point, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, no one would think it strange if you were counted among the dead. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Or do you want to be in prison until you die, for real this time?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"In that case, we can't sit around waiting for a rescue. If we don't get out on our own, I'll be locked up again."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, I think it'll be really hard. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... I don't want you going back to prison like this, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"If you help me escape, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you'll be an accomplice too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The Megasawa City case happened to save me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, so I'm just as guilty."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Honestly, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE><PG>
Honestly, I'm torn.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If a rescue team comes and things go on like this, I'll be put back in prison and spend the rest of my life there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What dulled my resolve to accept that was seeing <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> again, and the aroma of coffee.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there's no guarantee at all that if we go to Arata, they'll hide me.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "175" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Come on, let's go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What about </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Is </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> doing well?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> lowered her eyes.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ横顔32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I can't get in touch with her... I can't be too optimistic."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm thinking of stopping by </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> place last. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> didn't make it, I won't have anything left to keep me in Motoki City either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">With cherry trees this big around, I'm sure I'd collapse right away too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Your April sickness, this year too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. I figure it's never going to get better. So I thought, maybe it doesn't matter anymore..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Why didn't you move away before now? You should have left a place with this many cherry trees."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ考えるバストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm... Maybe I'd just gotten used to it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">April sickness is hard, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was here, and if I went to </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="みなかみし">Minakami City</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I could see you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Besides, I felt like if I left here, I'd lose the place where I could meet </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I've put you through a lot."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"If only we'd moved right away when we found out about your April sickness, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Come on, let's stop that kind of talk. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So from now on, let's do things we won't regret. Okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're right... When do we leave?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"The sooner the better. If you're feeling up to it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, right away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm fine. We have to get out before the rescue team comes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I've got my car, so let's go in that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With my <STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE>, I am going to escape from this town, and from my <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="ろうごく">prison</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is the place we're heading a paradise, or a deeper hell?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know.<PG>
But it's either go on living here like this, or get sent back behind the walls.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's all or nothing―I'm gambling on <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> proposal.
